{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AiliA is a tricky puzzle game where mirror reflections are made real. Manipulate mirrors and guide Ail through a stunning, reflected world to save her long-lost &quot;twin sister&quot; Lia, who was captured inside a mirror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677100/extras/0ad14d79e01710b20ce1845637dfad51.avif?t=1766481063\" width=600 height=86 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go into the mirrors and traverse through the reflections.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, flip, and rotate mirrors to manipulate the world around you. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677100/extras/eb41413fd617fa09c50c493037a08829.poster.avif?t=1766481063\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677100/extras/eb41413fd617fa09c50c493037a08829.webm?t=1766481063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677100/extras/eb41413fd617fa09c50c493037a08829.mp4?t=1766481063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677100/extras/dfe70b21976df0bef96e6c04836c25ed.avif?t=1766481063\" width=600 height=86 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through 7 unique worlds inspired by Chinese mythology.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve 100+ hand-crafted puzzles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cl